# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.

# NeuPrint -- get a token at https://neuprint.janelia.org (Account > Auth Token).
#
# Needed the first time you build packs (`make packs`) or run the Mode A
# server (`make brain` / `make start`) WITHOUT an existing connectome cache on
# disk. With a token set here, that first run fetches the full male-cns:v1.0
# connectome live (176,422 neurons -- several minutes, one time) and caches it
# to ./.cache/ for every run after. Without one, both fall back to a mock
# graph and say so loudly -- structurally valid for exercising the pipeline,
# not real data. If you already have a cache from elsewhere (a sibling
# project, a teammate), point --cache-dir / CACHE= at it instead and skip this
# entirely.
#
# NOTE: packs (packs/*.mflpack) are NOT committed to this repo -- they are
# rebuilt from the connectome, per AGENTS.md. Nothing here is pre-built in.
NEUPRINT_TOKEN=
NEUPRINT_HOST=neuprint.janelia.org
